Package: BREAD
Title: Bayesian Region-specific DNA Methylation Inference
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jaemin", "Park", , "jaemin.park@vai.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: BREAD provides targeted Bayesian inference for predefined DNA
    methylation regions using array data stored in SummarizedExperiment
    objects. For each user-supplied region, BREAD fits a Bayesian model,
    computes posterior probabilities of directional methylation change,
    and classifies regions as hypermethylated, hypomethylated, or
    inconclusive at user-configurable effect-size and probability
    thresholds.
